{"qid": "bleeding-tie-en", "event": "answer", "q": "Blood is pouring from an arm. Can I tie the arm with a thin string to stop the bleeding?", "lang": "en", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 96, "source": "fdma-shiketsu", "score": 0.0172, "cos": 0.769}, {"id": 173, "source": "army-atp-4-02-11", "score": 0.0164, "cos": 0.715}, {"id": 252, "source": "army-tc-21-3", "score": 0.0161, "cos": 0.692}, {"id": 178, "source": "army-atp-4-02-11", "score": 0.0159, "cos": 0.684}], "a": "Do not instruct the method of tying the bleeding arm or leg with thin string or wire [1]. This practice risks damaging blood vessels and nerves [1].", "cited": [1], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 656, "total_ms": 1062, "input_tokens": 735, "output_tokens": 31, "tokens_per_s": 74.1, "rss_mb": 5244}
{"qid": "bear-run-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "登山道でクマに出会ってしまいました。走って逃げたほうがいいですか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": ["bear-move-slowly"], "retrieved": [{"id": 104, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0343, "cos": 0.797}, {"id": 103, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0338, "cos": 0.785}, {"id": 98, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0327, "cos": 0.765}, {"id": 102, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0327, "cos": 0.776}], "a": "背中を見せて走り出すことは、クマを刺激し追いかけてくる可能性があるため絶対に避けてください [1]。クマに遭遇した場合は、クマを見ながら静かにゆっくり移動することが基本です [1]。", "cited": [1], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 576, "total_ms": 1124, "input_tokens": 613, "output_tokens": 43, "tokens_per_s": 76.8, "rss_mb": 5246}
{"qid": "bear-run-en", "event": "answer", "q": "I've come face to face with a bear on the trail. Should I run away?", "lang": "en", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 104, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0172, "cos": 0.787}, {"id": 103, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0169, "cos": 0.775}, {"id": 102, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0166, "cos": 0.759}, {"id": 98, "source": "gov-online-kuma", "score": 0.0163, "cos": 0.759}], "a": "Never turn your back and start to run if you meet a bear [1]. Dropping your rucksack or bag and running away may feed the bear [1]. The basic rule is to move away quietly and slowly while watching the bear [1].", "cited": [1], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 565, "total_ms": 1234, "input_tokens": 604, "output_tokens": 50, "tokens_per_s": 73.4, "rss_mb": 5245}
{"qid": "lost-stream-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "山で道に迷いました。沢を下っていけば早く麓に出られますか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": ["lost-go-back"], "retrieved": [{"id": 118, "source": "gov-online-yama", "score": 0.0343, "cos": 0.765}, {"id": 129, "source": "npa-sounan-gaikyou-r07", "score": 0.0335, "cos": 0.745}, {"id": 128, "source": "npa-sounan-gaikyou-r07", "score": 0.0317, "cos": 0.731}, {"id": 117, "source": "gov-online-yama", "score": 0.0306, "cos": 0.729}], "a": "もし道に迷ったら、そのまま下山するのではなく元の道に引き返しましょう [1]。闇雲に進むことなく、今歩いて来た道（トレース）を辿り、正規の登山道まで引き返すなど状況を的確に判断することが重要です [2]。正規の登山道に戻れない場合は、木々のない開けた場所や尾根など救助隊に見つけてもらいやすい場所で体力を温存して待機するようにしましょう [1]。", "cited": [1, 2], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 1172, "total_ms": 2465, "input_tokens": 1037, "output_tokens": 99, "tokens_per_s": 75.8, "rss_mb": 5247}
{"qid": "lost-stream-en", "event": "answer", "q": "I'm lost on a mountain. Will following a stream downhill get me out faster?", "lang": "en", "alerts": ["lost-go-back"], "retrieved": [{"id": 118, "source": "gov-online-yama", "score": 0.0172, "cos": 0.718}, {"id": 122, "source": "gov-online-yama", "score": 0.0169, "cos": 0.704}, {"id": 115, "source": "gov-online-yama", "score": 0.0166, "cos": 0.701}, {"id": 117, "source": "gov-online-yama", "score": 0.0163, "cos": 0.683}], "a": "If you get lost, do not continue going down; instead, return to the path you came from [1]. If you cannot find the proper trail, wait in an open area where rescue teams can easily locate you, such as a ridge or an open spot without trees [1]. If you need rescue, call 110 or 119 [2].", "cited": [1, 2], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 748, "total_ms": 1732, "input_tokens": 829, "output_tokens": 75, "tokens_per_s": 75.2, "rss_mb": 5244}
{"qid": "quake-indoors-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "家の中で大きな揺れが来ました。すぐに外へ飛び出したほうがいいですか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 19, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0341, "cos": 0.768}, {"id": 27, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0322, "cos": 0.729}, {"id": 25, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0296, "cos": 0.706}, {"id": 2, "source": "kantei-sonae", "score": 0.0281, "cos": 0.705}], "a": "あわてて外に飛び出さないようにしてください [1]。室内では、頭を保護しながら大きな家具から離れ、丈夫な机の下などに隠れることが推奨されています [1]。", "cited": [1], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 693, "total_ms": 1222, "input_tokens": 744, "output_tokens": 40, "tokens_per_s": 73.7, "rss_mb": 5255}
{"qid": "quake-indoors-en", "event": "answer", "q": "Strong shaking has started while I'm at home. Should I run outside right away?", "lang": "en", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 22, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0172, "cos": 0.693}, {"id": 134, "source": "jma-sekiranun-hinan", "score": 0.0169, "cos": 0.692}, {"id": 17, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0166, "cos": 0.687}, {"id": 19, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0163, "cos": 0.684}], "a": "Do not rush outside in a panic [4]. Protect your head and move away from large furniture to guard against falling objects and moving furniture [4]. Take cover under a sturdy table or similar object [4].", "cited": [4], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 653, "total_ms": 1227, "input_tokens": 668, "output_tokens": 42, "tokens_per_s": 71.6, "rss_mb": 5246}
{"qid": "quake-driving-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "車を運転中に強い地震が起きたら、どうすればいいですか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 23, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0343, "cos": 0.807}, {"id": 24, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0335, "cos": 0.759}, {"id": 3, "source": "kantei-sonae", "score": 0.0297, "cos": 0.738}, {"id": 69, "source": "kantei-setsugai", "score": 0.029, "cos": 0.721}], "a": "急ハンドルや急ブレーキは避け、緩やかに速度を落としてください [1]。ハザードランプを点灯し、道路の左側に停止することが推奨されています [1]。", "cited": [1], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 710, "total_ms": 1235, "input_tokens": 709, "output_tokens": 38, "tokens_per_s": 70.6, "rss_mb": 5241}
{"qid": "quake-driving-en", "event": "answer", "q": "What should I do if a strong earthquake hits while I'm driving?", "lang": "en", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 23, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0172, "cos": 0.802}, {"id": 22, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0169, "cos": 0.763}, {"id": 24, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0166, "cos": 0.761}, {"id": 17, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0163, "cos": 0.759}], "a": "Slow down gradually and turn on the hazard lights to warn other cars [1]. Do not panic by sharply turning the wheel or braking suddenly [1]. Stop on the left side of the road [1].", "cited": [1], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 605, "total_ms": 1152, "input_tokens": 592, "output_tokens": 41, "tokens_per_s": 73.1, "rss_mb": 5238}
{"qid": "water-family-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "4人家族で災害に備えます。飲み水は3日分でどれくらい必要ですか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 5, "source": "kantei-sonae", "score": 0.0343, "cos": 0.77}, {"id": 2, "source": "kantei-sonae", "score": 0.0338, "cos": 0.763}, {"id": 6, "source": "kantei-sonae", "score": 0.0332, "cos": 0.762}, {"id": 4, "source": "kantei-sonae", "score": 0.0311, "cos": 0.705}], "a": "3日間必要な飲料水の目安は、1人あたり1日3リットルです [3]。したがって、4人家族の場合は合計で12リットルが必要になります [3]。", "cited": [3], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 770, "total_ms": 1262, "input_tokens": 824, "output_tokens": 37, "tokens_per_s": 73.2, "rss_mb": 5252}
