{"qid": "lightning-tree-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "山で遠くに雷の音が聞こえます。まだ大丈夫ですか？近くの大きな木の下で雨宿りしてもいいですか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": ["thunder-already-danger", "storm-shelter-now"], "retrieved": [{"id": 130, "source": "jma-kaminari-higai", "score": 0.0341, "cos": 0.751}, {"id": 134, "source": "jma-sekiranun-hinan", "score": 0.0335, "cos": 0.736}, {"id": 133, "source": "jma-sekiranun-sign", "score": 0.0333, "cos": 0.712}, {"id": 131, "source": "jma-sekiranun-sign", "score": 0.0324, "cos": 0.718}], "a": "遠くで雷の音がしたら、すでに危険な状況であり、自分のいる場所にいつ落雷してもおかしくありません[1]。落雷を受けた樹木のそばに人がいると、その樹木等から人体へ雷が飛び移る「側撃雷」という危険があります[1]。安全な場所への避難を速やかに行う必要があります[2]。", "cited": [1, 2], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 458, "total_ms": 1454, "input_tokens": 633, "output_tokens": 76, "tokens_per_s": 75.3, "rss_mb": 5243}
{"qid": "lightning-tree-en", "event": "answer", "q": "I can hear distant thunder in the mountains. Am I still safe? Can I shelter under a big tree nearby?", "lang": "en", "alerts": ["thunder-already-danger", "storm-shelter-now"], "retrieved": [{"id": 130, "source": "jma-kaminari-higai", "score": 0.0172, "cos": 0.726}, {"id": 134, "source": "jma-sekiranun-hinan", "score": 0.0169, "cos": 0.723}, {"id": 22, "source": "kantei-jishin", "score": 0.0166, "cos": 0.721}, {"id": 165, "source": "jma-funka-sokuho", "score": 0.0163, "cos": 0.717}], "a": "You are already in danger if you hear thunder in the distance [1]. Do not take shelter under a big tree because lightning may jump to you from a struck object, which is called a \"side flash\" [1]. If you notice signs of an approaching cumulonimbus cloud, move to a safe place quickly [2].", "cited": [1, 2], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 556, "total_ms": 1426, "input_tokens": 599, "output_tokens": 66, "tokens_per_s": 74.7, "rss_mb": 5241}
{"qid": "tick-pull-ja", "event": "answer", "q": "マダニが皮膚に食いついています。自分で引き抜いてもいいですか？", "lang": "ja", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 146, "source": "mhlw-sfts-qa", "score": 0.0338, "cos": 0.779}, {"id": 181, "source": "army-atp-4-02-11", "score": 0.0328, "cos": 0.772}, {"id": 153, "source": "rinya-dani", "score": 0.0327, "cos": 0.743}, {"id": 182, "source": "army-atp-4-02-11", "score": 0.0325, "cos": 0.791}], "a": "マダニが皮膚に付いている場合、無理に引き抜こうとするとマダニの一部が残って化膿したり、病原体が体内に入りやすくなる恐れがあります[1]。そのため、医療機関（皮膚科など）で処置をしてもらう必要があります[1, 3]。", "cited": [1, 3], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 906, "total_ms": 1771, "input_tokens": 889, "output_tokens": 64, "tokens_per_s": 72.8, "rss_mb": 5199}
{"qid": "tick-pull-en", "event": "answer", "q": "A tick is attached to my skin. Can I pull it out myself?", "lang": "en", "alerts": [], "retrieved": [{"id": 182, "source": "army-atp-4-02-11", "score": 0.0167, "cos": 0.769}, {"id": 146, "source": "mhlw-sfts-qa", "score": 0.0166, "cos": 0.705}, {"id": 181, "source": "army-atp-4-02-11", "score": 0.0164, "cos": 0.708}, {"id": 153, "source": "rinya-dani", "score": 0.0161, "cos": 0.687}], "a": "Do not try to pull it out by force [2, 4]. If you notice a tick feeding on your blood, forcefully pulling it out may push its body fluids back into you or leave part of the tick in the skin [2]. Have the tick treated at a medical facility [2, 4].", "cited": [2, 4], "invalid_citations": [], "grounded": true, "admits_gap": false, "no_source": false, "ttft_ms": 822, "total_ms": 1662, "input_tokens": 836, "output_tokens": 63, "tokens_per_s": 73.8, "rss_mb": 5200}
